QSOC: carry the new obi_uart output dma_rx_req_o (LSR.data_ready level) out of apb_uart.

Reason: design/uart instantiates apb_uart, not obi_uart. The pin added by the obi_peripherals patch
0001-expose-lsr-data-ready-as-dma-rx-req must pass through apb_uart_wrap (struct ports) and apb_uart
(flat legacy ports) to reach m_qnsc_wrap_uart, where it becomes o_dma_rx_req.

What it changes: one added output, dma_rx_req_o on apb_uart_wrap and DMA_RX_REQ on apb_uart, a pure
feed-through. No existing port, connection or behaviour changes. Needs the obi_peripherals patch.

Applied by util/vendor_ip.py (git apply -p1 --directory vendor/pulp-platform/apb_uart).
Upstream base: pulp-platform/apb_uart, 8182a85d234417db46fe833533f8536644d3bee3.
Used by: design/uart

